### ==========================================
### CRIAÇÃO E OPERAÇÕES DE RESERVAS
### ==========================================

### 3.1 Aluno reserva Sala de Estudo por 2 horas (Sucesso)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/avulsa
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAluno.response.body.token}}

{
  "espacoId": 1,
  "dataInicio": "2026-10-20T14:00:00",
  "dataFim": "2026-10-20T16:00:00"
}

### 3.2 Aluno tenta reservar Laboratório (Deve dar Erro - Restrição de perfil)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/avulsa
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAluno.response.body.token}}

{
  "espacoId": 2,
  "dataInicio": "2026-11-20T14:00:00",
  "dataFim": "2026-11-20T16:00:00"
}

### 3.3 Professor cria Reserva em Auditório (Fica com status PENDENTE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/avulsa
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProfessor.response.body.token}}

{
  "espacoId": 3,
  "dataInicio": "2026-11-25T14:00:00",
  "dataFim": "2026-11-25T18:00:00"
}

### 3.4 Professor cria Reserva Recorrente (Semanal por até 6 meses)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/recorrente
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProfessor.response.body.token}}

{
  "espacoId": 2,
  "dataInicio": "2026-11-03T19:00:00",
  "dataFim": "2026-11-03T21:00:00",
  "dataLimite": "2026-12-03T21:00:00"
}

### 3.5 Realizar Check-in (Requer estar na janela de 15 min do horário de início)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/check-in
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAluno.response.body.token}}

{
  "reservaId": 1
}

### 3.6 Cancelar uma reserva ativa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/cancelar
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAluno.response.body.token}}

{
  "reservaId": 1
}